{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The core issue is in the order query layer: customer history is keyed by the immutable `ORDERS.CUSTOMER_ID`, but the API incorrectly requires the live customer row; pagination also computes page count with floor-plus-one and applies offsets to a collection-fetch query. I’m correcting both, while preserving the order’s stored email and address data when its customer no longer exists."}}
